# Tokyo Night, after Omarchy's tokyo-night theme (omacom/omarchy, MIT):
# soft text, dark backgrounds, and blue only where it means focus.
#
#   background #1a1b26  dark #13141c  darker #0e0e14  lighter #24283b
#   selection #292e42  muted #414868
#   foreground #a9b1d6  dark #737aa2  bright #c0caf5
#   accent #7aa2f7  magenta #ad8ee6  red #f7768e  yellow #e0af68  green #9ece6a

